# Prevent Git from corrupting binary font files via autocrlf line-ending
# conversion.  Without this, woff2/woff/ttf/otf files committed on Windows
# or checked out with core.autocrlf=true will get their bytes mangled,
# producing "OTS parsing error: invalid sfntVersion" in browsers.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
